  "source_snippet": "module BigFloatOperations\r\n\r\nimport Big\r\n\r\nprocedure main()\r\nis\r\n    let x: BigFloat = Big.float(\"10005\", 256)\r\n    let root: BigFloat = Big.sqrt(x)\r\n    let scaled: BigFloat = Big.mulFloat(Big.float(\"426880\", 256), root)\r\n    let text: String = Big.format(scaled, 5)\r\n    check String.instr(text, \".\") \u003e 0\r\nend main\r\n\r\nend BigFloatOperations\r\n",
